te </span><span begin="04:08.143" end="04:08.767">ku</span></text><text for="line-3cb7d42f-2c61-4ea4-8e28-654b061ce96d"><span begin="04:09.019" end="04:09.208">tsu </span><span begin="04:09.208" end="04:09.405">na </span><span begin="04:09.405" end="04:09.627">ga </span><span begin="04:09.627" end="04:09.939">ru </span><span begin="04:09.939" end="04:10.270">te </span><span begin="04:10.270" end="04:10.461">wo </span><span begin="04:10.461" end="04:11.081">to </span><span begin="04:11.081" end="04:11.314">t </span><span begin="04:11.314" end="04:13.831">te </span></text><text for="81ddfebc-9d0e-4d4b-b09a-4e8a5fe5c401"><span begin="04:02.192" end="04:02.807">hi </span><span begin="04:02.807" end="04:02.916">to </span><span begin="04:02.916" end="04:03.023">ri </span><span begin="04:03.023" end="04:03.327">ja </span><span begin="04:03.327" end="04:03.662">na </span><span begin="04:03.662" end="04:03.846">i </span><span begin="04:03.846" end="04:04.603">to</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><translations><translation type="subtitle"><text for="line-5d72fce5-5834-4c33-8abc-f00ce0609b79">即使去剥夺什么 借此得到</text><text for="line-020d2e21-7954-49f3-89f4-f059ce0b55cb">连同荒废的世界一起</text><text for="line-63bc1657-7d17-4fbd-8aa0-626bbd7e5c66">Just belive 强烈地</text><text for="line-8630d17f-c874-4449-8c5c-de9891d33c76">贯彻这心意</text><text for="line-64db8d86-67f4-46cf-af21-0e3510af4bc6">一路走来的羁绊…现在</text><text for="line-57e6d01d-c645-44c7-9d68-0504ed9e596d">无法放手的</text><text for="line-ab9304b6-7cc2-4d75-8a1b-b99d7db8be5e">不会放手的</text><text for="line-d674252f-241d-4d3e-b1ca-87eac2e18c6a">未来</text><text for="line-2058666d-1827-4f4e-832c-f798b6f5d2a1">比完美的理想</text><text for="line-7488f9b7-d7da-457e-9531-71b4c2d0ee99">更炽烈地回响</text><text for="line-ec436579-e1a9-4cb7-a6f0-379d5537f337">毁灭所昭示的</text><text for="line-e74db73a-3efc-4376-8084-04e74f62c541">一个人传向另一个人</text><text for="line-1fa410b6-f8f8-4d23-8374-e20337b52414">不断编织着的事物</text><text for="line-1aa58062-d930-4a86-ba88-dc142edfbb08">向着信念起誓</text><text for="line-5062c038-dc58-4695-8786-2f1e3f5241cb">“不要放弃活下去</text><text for="line-f0ed4df4-c18b-4bbf-8c64-fc8e196e03b1">绝不是孤身一人”</text><text for="line-0a509a8d-520b-4aef-b2d9-808eb94d10ad">牵起相连的手吧…</text><text for="line-50d162dd-0081-494c-86a9-27011c2491aa">无法挣脱的绝望</text><text for="line-32609322-2209-467c-a0f0-e0bf65a087c5">袭向截然相反的意志（心灵）</text><text for="line-f52020f4-f240-4982-9d54-2701cd4a0b2b">唯一那份毫不动摇的</text><text for="line-e4b941f3-1073-4054-b1f7-1ab4cfb0e1f6">眼泪的意义呢？</text><text for="line-67528ba8-40a6-4a88-bcc2-18fc31cd4eea">Just belive 总有一天</text><text for="line-da3cde36-79c0-4be9-8206-a8b87ecb2ca7">为了能够相视而笑</text><text for="line-531d823b-a586-46fe-bac3-66f39f5f00ab">有谁会再次将爱照亮</text><text for="line-7bcfcac4-37db-4c8d-ba8b-f6ab11efe8b2">不断重复着的</text><text for="line-9d95ffc0-c337-47f4-8dce-ce2d244e9929">已经重复过的</text><text for="line-ea2d0500-6a1f-4756-997e-eac059c0a7b1">正义…</text><text for="line-5385f074-f70b-4c14-984d-e30af87aee5c">无法控制地</text><text for="line-1acefbed-cb80-4f2b-a529-68d769f1b711">高高挥舞着</text><text for="line-dd0469bb-07a7-483a-9490-7423e4f17f94">已经无法停止</text><text for="8e338a8c-7c47-4852-b125-57e9a94e31c9">1000年后的愚蠢世界里</text><text for="line-9dd024b2-5f4b-44e3-a080-3383041a8652">一个人思念着另一个人</text><text for="line-1145c700-7a0f-420c-83ef-79c444bda434">不断伸出的援手</text><text for="line-a24a9e13-704d-4a4b-9381-0adbfe479cb1">比什么都要坚固</text><text for="line-3b6e502d-fd06-4fd1-b291-1d5b63771279">活下去这件事</text><text for="line-820b4f08-8131-4fdb-8dc7-f270bb59b981">人们又为何要互相帮助呢</text><text for="line-769628e1-360f-4df0-bd65-18381ad4aebd">那是为了与一切的</text><text for="line-30e1bb33-0947-4429-873b-504c0a4047e6">若是澄澈的眼眸睁开的话</text><text for="line-250e4104-6068-452e-bf45-dc882f1f0ebc">便能手牵手走向信念</text><text for="line-d5efe38b-7107-4169-9a7d-c0c57cd4dd78">1000年后、</text><text for="line-3ff4e4ab-559c-43e2-882b-dac2695480e0">一个人传向另一个人</text><text for="line-3be42f9a-9a8a-4f7e-b8fc-b85abf21b77e">不断编织着的事物</text><text for="line-f48fae23-606b-48a1-8c7a-164c8896aac8">向着信念起誓</text><text for="line-bac39964-2fe7-41d1-89c1-1c731d41aa68">“不要放弃活下去</text><text for="line-2f07d1ba-0335-459d-91fc-1f95d70d09cd">以这首歌开始去证明</text><text for="line-3cb7d42f-2c61-4ea4-8e28-654b061ce96d">牵起相连的手吧…</text><text for="670a0d38-d761-4881-b960-519cbb5f57d0">那就是会因此满足的梦吗？</text><text for="9b494c47-1a32-4169-8869-eabbbc989d60">逆转的决心</text><text for="92bc8bdd-6fa9-45e1-bb07-703cf7e0b8db">这1000年后的世界 即使知晓</text><text for="0eec4b26-cff8-4529-8fec-534af372c5c1">以这首歌开始去证明</text><text for="line-735187e3-aadb-4a7d-8744-46334c3f5bc2">即使是在被封锁着的</text><text for="971a8f7c-0e7e-4234-8fd2-2acdd500f453">如果说是罪孽的话</text><text for="b6460d4a-fd88-4417-9be8-a60e1ea310c4">未来相连</text><text for="50038c0d-1d0b-41bc-84f1-a7b18115bbc7">甚至更遥远的将来 也不要忘记梦想</text><text for="81ddfebc-9d0e-4d4b-b09a-4e8a5fe5c401">绝不是孤身一人”</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="04:15.206"><div><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-5d72fce5-5834-4c33-8abc-f00ce0609b79" itunes:key="line-5d72fce5-5834-4c33-8abc-f00ce0609b79" begin="00:37.105" end="00:40.265" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="00:37.105" end="00:37.526" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:37.105" end="00:37.345">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:37.345" end="00:37.526">に</span></span></span><span begin="00:37.526" end="00:37.725">か</span><span begin="00:37.725" end="00:38.105" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">奪</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:37.725" end="00:37.965">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:37.965" end="00:38.105">ば</span></span></span><span begin="00:38.105" end="00:38.765">い</span> <span begin="00:38.765" end="00:39.005" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">得</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:38.765" end="00:39.005">え</span></span></span><span begin="00:39.005" end="00:39.206">た</span><span begin="00:39.206" end="00:39.365">と</span><span begin="00:39.365" end="00:39.845">し</span><span begin="00:39.845" end="00:40.265">て</span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="670a0d38-d761-4881-b960-519cbb5f57d0" itunes:key="670a0d38-d761-4881-b960-519cbb5f57d0" begin="00:40.425" end="00:43.765" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="00:40.474" end="00:40.680">そ</span><span begin="00:40.680" end="00:40.860">れ</span><span begin="00:40.860" end="00:41.062">で</span><span begin="00:41.062" end="00:41.285" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">満</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:41.062" end="00:41.285">み</span></span></span><span begin="00:41.285" end="00:41.405">た</span><span begin="00:41.405" end="00:41.705">さ</span><span begin="00:41.705" end="00:41.905">れ</span><span begin="00:41.905" end="00:42.325">て</span><span begin="00:42.325" end="00:42.665">く</span><span begin="00:42.665" end="00:43.565" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:42.665" end="00:43.145">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:43.145" end="00:43.565">め</span></span></span><span begin="00:43.565" end="00:43.765">？</span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-020d2e21-7954-49f3-89f4-f059ce0b55cb" itunes:key="line-020d2e21-7954-49f3-89f4-f059ce0b55cb" begin="00:43.765" end="00:46.905" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="00:43.765" end="00:44.165" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">荒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:43.765" end="00:43.985">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:43.985" end="00:44.165">う</span></span></span><span begin="00:44.165" end="00:44.545" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">廃</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:44.165" end="00:44.385">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:44.385" end="00:44.545">い</span></span></span><span begin="00:44.545" end="00:44.745">す</span><span begin="00:44.745" end="00:45.125">る</span> <span begin="00:45.385" end="00:45.625" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">世</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:45.385" end="00:45.625">せ</span></span></span><span begin="00:45.625" end="00:46.045" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">界</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:45.625" end="00:45.845">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:45.845" end="00:46.045">い</span></span></span><span begin="00:46.045" end="00:46.465">ご</span><span begin="00:46.465" end="00:46.905">と</span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="9b494c47-1a32-4169-8869-eabbbc989d60" itunes:key="9b494c47-1a32-4169-8869-eabbbc989d60" begin="00:47.025" end="00:49.005" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="00:47.059" end="00:47.487" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">逆</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:47.059" end="00:47.278">ぎゃ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:47.278" end="00:47.487">く</span></span></span><span begin="00:47.487" end="00:47.986" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">転</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:47.487" end="00:47.756">て</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:47.756" end="00:47.986">ん</span></span></span><span begin="00:47.986" end="00:48.260">へ</span><span begin="00:48.260" end="00:48.518">の</span> <span begin="00:48.518" end="00:49.005">Will</span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-63bc1657-7d17-4fbd-8aa0-626bbd7e5c66" itunes:key="line-63bc1657-7d17-4fbd-8aa0-626bbd7e5c66" begin="00:49.325" end="00:52.805" ttm:agent="v1 v2"><span begin="00:49.325" end="00:49.752">Just </span><span begin="00:49.752" end="00:50.180">be</span><span begin="00:50.180" end="00:51.191">lieve</span> <span begin="00:51.375" end="00:51.845" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="bas